# Evidence

Use one evidence chain: run -> completion -> outcome -> evidence.

Every claim names the exact tree, command, executed path, result, and known red
aggregate. A focused pass is not an aggregate pass. A zero needs a positive
control. Do not paste stale current-state summaries into semantic authority.
